// Browser/OS Web Push subscription (standard Push API + VAPID). Scoped to
// storeId, not userId — a shared shop device can be operated by rotating
// staff PIN personas that carry no User.id of their own (see
// src/lib/api-handler.ts), so push fan-out targets every device subscribed
